                GrammarSection(heading: "although / even though ＝ 〜だけど", keyword: "although",
                               chunks: [c("Although", "逆接", 1), c("it was raining", "状況", 2), c("we went out", "結果", 0)],
                               examples: [e("Although it was raining, we went out.", "ɔːlðˈəʊ ɪt wɒz ɹˈeɪnɪŋ wiː wɛnt ˈaʊt", "雨だったけど、出かけた。"),
                                          e("I like him, even though he's always late.", "aɪ lˈaɪk hˌɪm ˈiːvən ðˌəʊ hiːz ˈɔːlweɪz lˈeɪt", "いつも遅刻するけど、彼のことは好きだ。")]),
            ],
            tipTitle: "見分け方",
            tip: "because の後ろは「原因」、so の後ろは「結果」。順番が逆になる。but は文の途中、although は文の頭にも使える。",
            wrong: "Because it was raining, so I stayed home.", right: "It was raining, so I stayed home."),

